{% slide title="Plan a trip" align="center" hideNavigation=false %}
{% columns %}
{% column %}
Now you plan a trip with the assistant.
Use the elements from the slides before.
A good question has the **need,** **place** and **time.**
Some questions need only one place, like a museum.
Some questions need two places, a start and an end.
Remember: do not use your personal data
{% /column %}
{% column %}
![slide_2_Freeform_8.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/6-4/slide_2_Freeform_8.png)
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}
{% /slide %}

{% slide title="Activity 1: Where is the toilet?" align="center" hideNavigation=false %}
{% columns %}
{% column %}
**The context**
I am outside the Colosseum. I have to go to the toilet.
What is the **need**? → "I need a toilet"
Which is the **place**? ⟶ "I am outside the Colosseum"
The prompt → "I am outside the Colosseum. Where is a toilet?"
**Your task**
Read or write the prompt to AI.
{% /column %}
{% column %}
![slide_3_Freeform_7.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/6-4/slide_3_Freeform_7.png)
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}
{% /slide %}

{% slide title="Check the answer" align="center" hideNavigation=false %}
{% columns %}
{% column %}
Read or listen to the answer.
Does the answer talk about your **need**?
Does the answer talk about your **place**?
Is something missing? Ask again with one more detail.
{% /column %}
{% column %}
![slide_4_Freeform_7.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/6-4/slide_4_Freeform_7.png)

![slide_4_Freeform_8.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/6-4/slide_4_Freeform_8.png)
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}
{% /slide %}

{% slide title="Activity 2: You choose the place" align="center" hideNavigation=false %}
{% columns %}
{% column %}
**The context**
You want to buy a ticket for the bus.
You do not know where to buy it.
Pick one place of your choice.
**Your task**
"Where can I buy a bus ticket near ...?"
Does the answer talk about your need?
Does the answer talk about your place?
Is something missing? Ask again with one more detail.
{% /column %}
{% column %}
