{% slide title="The assistant can ask you questions" align="center" hideNavigation=false %}
{% columns %}
{% column %}
Usually you ask a question and the assistant answers.
The assistant can ask first.
First, the assistant asks you some easy questions.
You answer each question with your own words.
Then the assistant makes a plan for you.
{% /column %}
{% column %}
![slide_11_Freeform_7.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/6-4/slide_11_Freeform_7.png)
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}

Advanced
activity
{% /slide %}

{% slide title="Example" align="center" hideNavigation=false %}
{% columns %}
{% column %}
You: "Help me plan one day in Rome. Ask me some question first."
Assistant: "What time do you want to start?"
You: "At 10 o'clock."
Assistant: "Do you prefer the taxi or the metro?"
You: "The metro."
Assistant: "Here is your plan."
{% /column %}
{% column %}
![slide_12_Freeform_7.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/6-4/slide_12_Freeform_7.png)
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}

Advanced
activity
{% /slide %}

{% slide title="Activity 5: A day in Rome with the AI" align="center" hideNavigation=false %}
{% columns %}
{% column %}
**The context**
You want to spend one whole day in Rome.
You want the assistant to help you plan it.
**Your task**
Read or write the first prompt to AI.
"Help me plan one day in Rome. Ask me 5 question first"
Answer each question of the assistant one by one.
Remember: do not share your personal data
{% /column %}
{% column %}
![slide_13_Freeform_7.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/6-4/slide_13_Freeform_7.png)
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}

